WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.123 --> 00:00:04.927
HISTORIC BUILDING BUILT IN 1936.

00:00:02.958 --> 00:00:06.595
ONE DOOR DOESN'T LOCK AND

00:00:05.061 --> 00:00:06.896
ANOTHER DOOR LEAKS WHEN IT

00:00:06.729 --> 00:00:10.833
RAINS.

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.001
WE TOLD YOU PRESIDENT TRUMP IS

00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:13.436
GETTING PRAISE FROM UNUSUAL

00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:17.406
QUARTERS ABOUT NORTH KOREA.

00:00:13.569 --> 00:00:22.244
THE SAME IS TRUE REGARDING HIS

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:25.648
DECISION TO SLAP TARRIFS ON

00:00:22.378 --> 00:00:27.316
STEEL AND ALUMINUM.

00:00:25.781 --> 00:00:28.150
MIKE EMANUEL LOOKS AT THIS.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:31.921
&gt;&gt; STEEL IS STEEL.

00:00:28.284 --> 00:00:33.089
&gt;&gt; THE IMAGES WERE STRIKING.

00:00:32.054 --> 00:00:35.891
A REPUBLICAN PRESIDENT

00:00:33.222 --> 00:00:36.892
SURROUNDED BY UNION WORKERS WHO

00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:37.793
TRADITIONALLY SUPPORT DEMOCRATS.

00:00:37.026 --> 00:00:39.528
IT DIDN'T END.

00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:41.397
THERE THE STEEL AND ALUMINUM

00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:44.800
UNION MEMBERS PRAISED THE

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:45.134
PRESIDENT FOR STANDING UP FOR

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:48.270
WORKERS.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:49.939
&gt;&gt; HE WAS SINCERE ABOUT HELPING

00:00:48.404 --> 00:00:51.674
THE STEEL WORKERS OUT.

00:00:50.072 --> 00:00:53.909
HE EMPHASIZED OUR STRUGGLES.

00:00:51.807 --> 00:00:55.444
&gt;&gt; AND AN ALUMINUM WORKER SAID

00:00:54.043 --> 00:00:58.214
HIS FACILITY IS ONLY OPERATING

00:00:55.578 --> 00:01:00.950
AT 40% CAPACITY BUT SAID THE

00:00:58.347 --> 00:01:02.184
PRESIDENT'S SIGNATURE SHOULD

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:04.520
HAVE AN IMMEDIATE IMPACT.

00:01:02.318 --> 00:01:06.222
&gt;&gt; WITH THESE TARRIFS, THIS

00:01:04.653 --> 00:01:08.457
GIVES US THE ABILITY TO COME

00:01:06.355 --> 00:01:12.361
BACK TO 100% CAPACITY AND INVEST

00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:16.298
IN OVER $100-MILLION TO OUR

00:01:12.495 --> 00:01:17.133
PLANT AND OVER 300JOBS WILL BE

00:01:16.432 --> 00:01:18.234
BROUGHT BACK TO THE COMMUNITY.

00:01:17.266 --> 00:01:19.935
&gt;&gt; THEY TALKED ABOUT THIS

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:21.237
PRESIDENT TRYING TO LEVEL THE

00:01:20.069 --> 00:01:21.570
PLAYING FIELD FOR AMERICAN

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.939
WORKERS.

00:01:21.704 --> 00:01:26.275
&gt;&gt; I APPLAUD THIS ADMINISTRATION

00:01:24.073 --> 00:01:28.511
FOR HAVING THE COURAGE TO LEVY

00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:31.013
TARRIFS TO STOP THE CHEATING.

00:01:28.644 --> 00:01:35.117
&gt;&gt; AND UNITED STEEL WORKERS

00:01:31.147 --> 00:01:39.655
PRESIDENT SAID BY ENSURING

00:01:35.251 --> 00:01:43.492
SPLICE FOR STEEL AND ALUMINUM

00:01:39.789 --> 00:01:43.859
MR. TRUMP IS SUPPORTING NATIONAL

00:01:43.626 --> 00:01:50.099
SECURITY.

00:01:43.993 --> 00:01:54.837
A BIG CHANGE FROM WHEN HE SPOKE

00:01:50.232 --> 00:01:56.238
AT A RALLY FOR HILLARY CLINTON.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:59.308
&gt;&gt; TRUMP NEVER SAID IS THERE

00:01:56.372 --> 00:02:00.075
ANYTHING I CAN DO TO HELP.

00:01:59.441 --> 00:02:03.145
&gt;&gt; TRADITIONAL REPUBLICANS VIEW

00:02:00.209 --> 00:02:05.915
THE MEASURES AS ATTACKS.

